<rtept lat="51.4408500000" lon="-0.7172600000">
<time>2025-07-25T16:59:55Z</time>
<name>5 Bar Gate to Ashmore Lane </name>
<desc><![CDATA[Continue on the enclosed path through the fields until you reach Kingscroft Lane (A330).  Cross straight over into Garsons Lane. Follow this quiet, narrow road until you reach a bend in the road where you'll have Old Whitelock's farm in front of you. Sweep around the corner and take the road on your left.  After approx. 250m, Hog Oak Lane will appear on your right.  Turn into the lane and continue.  

Keep walking past the nature reserve until the start of the woodland on your left.  Take the staggered barrier on your left into Ashmore Lane.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
