<time>2025-07-25T16:59:55Z</time>
<name>Ashmore Lane  to A330</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Ashmore Lane is reputed to be one of the prettiest lanes in the borough, especially when the Bluebells appear in the spring.  Continue down the path until you reach the junction with Hawthorn Lane. Turn right here.  
Continue straight on this path, past Lordlands Farm, the end of Church Lane, and the old icehouse.  Continue to the junction with the A330.  ]]></desc>
