<time>2025-07-25T16:59:55Z</time>
<name>Hazelwood Lane to Buckle Lane</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Turn left down Hazelwood Lane, following the road past the mobile home encampment. Just after the encampment, the road bends around to the left. Do not follow this bend; instead, continue straight on following the bridleway signs. 
 
As you pass down the lane, you pass a small stable yard on your right and a beautiful big bungalow on your left.  The next lane you come to on your left is Buckle Lane. Take this lane and pass through the gate.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
