<rtept lat="51.4474430532" lon="-0.7583573714">
<time>2025-07-26T06:30:41Z</time>
<name>Buckle Lane to End</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Follow Buckle Lane up to the pub on the corner of Maidenhead Road.  This is a lovely pub serving a range of hot and cold food (dogs allowed inside and out).

Cross over the main road (A3095) with care and go ahead into Bowyers Lane. Continue uphill onto Wellers Lane, and the car park will be on the left.
]]></desc>
